cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this anchor log, please cite it as below."
title: "CausalLayer Anchor Log: Public Ed25519-signed Merkle anchor records for AI-liability attribution certificates"
abstract: >-
  This repository is the canonical, append-only, public anchor log for
  CausalLayer, a deterministic post-incident causal-attribution engine for AI
  failures. Each anchor is an Ed25519-signed Merkle root over a daily set of
  attribution-certificate digests, optionally timestamped by OpenTimestamps
  against the Bitcoin blockchain. The log permits any third party to verify,
  offline and without trusting CausalLayer, that a given attribution
  certificate existed in its current form on its asserted date.
authors:
  - family-names: Alford
    given-names: Jarrod
    affiliation: CausalLayer
type: dataset
license: CC0-1.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/smq9sn5jck-coder/causallayer-anchor-log"
url: "https://github.com/smq9sn5jck-coder/causallayer-anchor-log"
keywords:
